# The migration runner hashes each .sql file's raw bytes and refuses to re-run a
# file whose checksum changed (apps/api/src/db/migrate.ts). With core.autocrlf
# on, a checkout rewrites line endings, the hash moves, and the API dies at boot
# claiming an applied migration was edited. Pin the endings instead.
*.sql text eol=lf

# Same reasoning for anything else whose bytes are hashed, signed or executed
# in a container built from this tree.
*.sh text eol=lf
Dockerfile text eol=lf
*.yml text eol=lf
*.yaml text eol=lf
